8/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathsize=\"0.85em\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow></mstyle></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>First, we need to find the change-of-coordinates matrix <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"84\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.109em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle size=\"sm\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c43 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2192\"></mjx-c></